From: Omarchy Mobile <omamobile@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: msm8953-xiaomi-markw: add the touch keys

The Redmi 4 Prime has three touch keys under the screen: menu, home and
back. They belong to the maXTouch controller, which reports them through
its T15 key array (enabled, one by three keys on this unit's
configuration), but without a keymap atmel_mxt_ts drops the messages.

Map the three keys, left to right, to KEY_MENU, KEY_HOMEPAGE and
KEY_BACK.

---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8953-xiaomi-markw.dts | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8953-xiaomi-markw.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8953-xiaomi-markw.dts
@@ -270,6 +270,9 @@
 		vdd-supply = <&pm8953_l10>;
 
 		atmel,wakeup-method = <ATMEL_MXT_WAKEUP_I2C_SCL>;
+
+		/* The touch keys under the screen, left to right */
+		linux,keycodes = <KEY_MENU KEY_HOMEPAGE KEY_BACK>;
 		status = "disabled";
 	};
 };
